      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabControlOverflowPopupSearchDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Customize the overflow popup with search and keyboard navigation.</source>
        <target state="translated">為溢出彈層加入搜尋與鍵盤導覽。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabControlOverflowPopupSearchTitle">
