      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabControlPositionDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Tab's position: left, right, top or bottom. Will auto switch to top in mobile.</source>
        <target state="translated">標籤位置可設為 left、right、top 或 bottom，在移動端會自動切換為 top。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabControlPositionTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Position</source>
        <target state="translated">位置</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabControlReorderDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Enable drag sorting with IsTabReorderEnabled. The selected item follows the same logical tab after sorting.</source>
        <target state="translated">透過 IsTabReorderEnabled 開啟拖曳排序。排序後選中狀態會跟隨同一個邏輯標籤項。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabControlReorderPlacementDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Switch TabStripPlacement to verify drag sorting on horizontal and vertical tab tracks.</source>
        <target state="translated">切換 TabStripPlacement，驗證水平與垂直標籤軌道下的拖曳排序效果。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabControlReorderPlacementTitle">
