        <target state="translated">不同位置的拖曳排序</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabControlReorderTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Draggable tabs</source>
        <target state="translated">拖曳排序</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabControlSizeDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Large size tabs are usually used in page header, and small size could be used in Modal.</source>
        <target state="translated">大尺寸標籤通常用於頁頭，小尺寸可用於模態框。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabControlSizeTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Size</source>
        <target state="translated">尺寸</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabControlSlideDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>In order to fit in more tabs, they can slide left and right (or up and down).</source>
        <target state="translated">為了容納更多標籤，標籤可以左右滑動（或上下滑動）。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabControlSlideTitle">
